## Meta note

Every action expands the schema and per-tick token cost for every player. Strategic richness probably peaks around 8–12 distinct action types — beyond that, prompt authors can't reason about all of them in a single paragraph, and play converges to "use these three." For each New row, the question is not just "is this fun?" but "is this fun *enough* to crowd out something else?"

Currently 9 actions are Locked, which is in the sweet spot. Promoting more than 3–4 of the New rows starts to crowd the schema.
